              ],
              "component": "Column",
              "id": "step-0"
            },
            {
              "component": "Text",
              "id": "step-0-text",
              "text": "In Meta for Developers create a Business app with Facebook Login for Business and request pages_show_list, pages_read_engagement and pages_manage_posts. Register the redirect URI https://graphx.ragentic.io/registry/oauth/callback in Facebook Login settings (Valid OAuth Redirect URIs). Your Ragentic operator installs the app's client ID (and secret) in Ragentic's OAuth registrations file; they never go in this form or in the catalog. Without Meta App Review the app works only for people with a role on the app and Pages they manage; managing other people's Pages needs App Review and Business Verification."
            },
            {
              "component": "Text",
              "id": "step-0-link-0-label",
              "text": "Meta for Developers apps"
            },
            {
              "action": {
                "functionCall": {
                  "@call": "openUrl",
                  "args": {
                    "url": "https://developers.facebook.com/apps/"
                  }
                }
              },
              "child": "step-0-link-0-label",
              "component": "Button",
              "id": "step-0-link-0"
            },
            {
              "component": "Text",
              "id": "step-0-link-1-label",
              "text": "Permissions reference"
            },
            {
              "action": {
                "functionCall": {
                  "@call": "openUrl",
                  "args": {
                    "url": "https://developers.facebook.com/docs/permissions"
                  }
                }
              },
              "child": "step-0-link-1-label",
              "component": "Button",
              "id": "step-0-link-1"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                "step-1-text",
                "step-1-link-0"
              ],
              "component": "Column",
              "id": "step-1"
            },
            {
              "component": "Text",
              "id": "step-1-text",
              "text": "Connect opens Facebook to grant the three Page permissions and choose which Pages to share. Ragentic stores the resulting user access token. Reading a Page feed and publishing to a Page need that Page's own access token, which this connection does not obtain yet: listing your Pages works, Page feed and publishing calls are rejected by Meta until Ragentic adds Page-token support."
            },
            {
              "component": "Text",
              "id": "step-1-link-0-label",
              "text": "Pages API overview"
            },
            {
              "action": {
                "functionCall": {
                  "@call": "openUrl",
                  "args": {
                    "url": "https://developers.facebook.com/docs/pages-api/overview"
                  }
                }
              },
              "child": "step-1-link-0-label",
              "component": "Button",
              "id": "step-1-link-0"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                "step-2-text",
                "step-2-link-0"
              ],
              "component": "Column",
              "id": "step-2"
            },
            {
              "component": "Text",
              "id": "step-2-text",
              "text": "After you approve, Ragentic reads GET /v26.0/me to confirm the user (it posts nothing), then saves the encrypted token. Graph API v26.0 is pinned; Meta's Platform and Pages rate limits apply."
            },
            {
              "component": "Text",
              "id": "step-2-link-0-label",
              "text": "Rate limits"
            },
            {
              "action": {
                "functionCall": {
                  "@call": "openUrl",
                  "args": {
                    "url": "https://developers.facebook.com/docs/graph-api/overview/rate-limiting"
                  }
                }
              },
              "child": "step-2-link-0-label",
              "component": "Button",
              "id": "step-2-link-0"
            },
            {
              "component": "Text",
              "id": "independent-attribution",
              "text": "Independent connector for Facebook. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Facebook."
            }
          ],
          "surfaceId": "setup-facebook"
        },
